# A no-BS guide for developers to implement SSO
created: 2025-04-21, last updated: 2025-10-21, [Read more](https://dev.to/saif_shines/a-no-bs-guide-for-developers-to-implement-sso-1kkn)

Your app should redirect enterprise users to their company's identity provider to authenticate.
Scalekit's SDK helps you generate the correct Authorization URL.
```
import { ScalekitClient } from '@scalekit-sdk/node';
const scalekit = new ScalekitClient(
<SCALEKIT_ENVIRONMENT_URL>,
<SCALEKIT_CLIENT_ID>,
<SCALEKIT_CLIENT_SECRET>,
);
const options = {};
options['loginHint'] = 'user@example.com';
const authorizationURL = scalekit.getAuthorizationUrl(redirectUrl, options);
```
This returns:
```
https://<SCALEKIT_ENVIRONMENT_URL>/authorize?
client_id=<SCALEKIT_CLIENT_ID>&
redirect_uri=https://yourapp.com/auth/callback&
login_hint=<enterprise_user_email>
```

